      "created_at": "2026-03-01T11:41:32.519Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi Team,</p>\n<p>I need guidance on handling a purchase price difference scenario in ERPNext.</p>\n<p>We purchased material from a supplier at ₹50/kg.<br>\nLater, the supplier changed the rate at ₹52/kg, And send us debit note of 2 rs/kg plus gst</p>\n<p>There is <strong>no change in quantity and no stock return</strong>.<br>\nOnly the price has increased by ₹2/kg.</p>\n<p>What is the correct way to record this in ERPNext So it will impact correctly in GST reports and as well as in General Ledger?</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/smit_vora\">@Smit_Vora</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/snv\">@snv</a></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/riddhi11/{size}/94432_2.png",
