      "created_at": "2026-03-05T12:05:31.228Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/riddhi11\">@riddhi11</a></p>\n<p>Since PO is already submitted, the purchase receipt and invoice both offer additional charges to be applied on actual basis in tax table where you have luxury to either add it on item valuation or not.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/f/3f55c2b8547f93d04bcaa5eeda5bac6ae671a0d1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3f55c2b8547f93d04bcaa5eeda5bac6ae671a0d1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/f/3f55c2b8547f93d04bcaa5eeda5bac6ae671a0d1_2_690x317.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"92hOXuZVMdvLMsIa9yuAMw9NiiB\" width=\"690\" height=\"317\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/f/3f55c2b8547f93d04bcaa5eeda5bac6ae671a0d1_2_690x317.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/f/3f55c2b8547f93d04bcaa5eeda5bac6ae671a0d1_2_1035x475.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/f/3f55c2b8547f93d04bcaa5eeda5bac6ae671a0d1_2_1380x634.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F2F4F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1869×861 59.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
